  (text "DRAFT: no Pi connection before protection / footprint / thermal validation.\nCurrent: shunt pads 1 -> 4. Kelvin: pads 2 (+) and 3 (-).\nSupply: 5.1 V only. Controller and its VOUT supply remain before shunt.\nNo bulk capacitance after shunt. Pi-side UART buffer overhead IS measured.\nJ2 is one continuous long-tail socket with male pass-through." (at 230 375 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid "67a4bbd1-29ac-5b22-9ab0-d6796856e5d3"))
